{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QHswBycRhE1793242369.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯合國大會通過決議，再次敦促美國終止制裁古巴。古巴表示歡迎，稱面對美方欺凌不會屈服。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UN.CUBA-1030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Uo0jWFN7SJ1793242366.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>聯合國大會周三以130票贊成，17票反對，通過由古巴提出的決議，要求美國終止對古巴的經濟、商業和金融封鎖，是連續第34次通過類似決議。古巴國家主席迪亞斯卡內爾同日在社交媒體發文，對決議獲通過表示歡迎，並稱面對美國的威脅，古巴絕不會退縮。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UN.CUBA-1030_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xwl5YfnP3g1793242359.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國駐古巴大使館當日則在大樓頂部，掛起寫有「自由250」字樣的橫額。</p><p></p><p>自1962年起，美國就對古巴實施全面經濟、金融封鎖和貿易禁運，古巴數十年來一直面臨嚴重經濟與金融問題。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.823012+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:11.774425+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:30.072990+00:00","content_hash":"13308c772bb5b2d5af7a52d9cf1502f3c586e5dcec874e101d48c19dd54075eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.823012+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}